  "description": "3-phase multimeter with RS-485 Modbus RTU: voltages, currents, power and cos phi, two energy counter sets, min/max/demand values and setup. Values are 32-bit (two registers), energies 64-bit.",
  "revision": 3,
  "revised": "2026-11-10",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "EPM-07S Multimeter Modbus Register Map",
      "version": "A3919/Rev.2",
      "date": "2019-12",
      "url": "https://www.entes.com.tr/uploads/files/EPM-07S_Multimeter_Modbus_Register_Map_EN.pdf",
      "note": "register table; 32-bit format from the MPR-53S manual"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "This map also replaces the unofficial \"EPM-07\" entry that was in this library: the same register table (the model without S has no Modbus port).",
    "The previous map treated the values as 16-bit and had the addresses shifted; the table lists 32-bit values (two registers each), with unused rows for angles and THD.",
    "Energy counters and min/max/demand values can be written to set or clear them.",
    "The table does not state word order. Big-endian, high word first, is taken from the MPR-53S manual. Not tested on a device."
  ],
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
